Conversational Memory Intelligence System
Objective

Build an intelligent conversational memory system capable of remembering user information across multiple conversations while ensuring:

relevant memory retrieval
user isolation
privacy
token-efficient prompts
memory updates
deletion
observability

The system extends a traditional Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) architecture with persistent conversational memory.

Problem

LLMs forget everything after every request.

A simple vector database also fails because

stores everything
retrieves irrelevant memories
cannot forget
cannot resolve contradictions
leaks data between users

Our improved architecture solves these issues.

Success Metrics
Retrieval Accuracy > 90%
P95 latency < 1 sec
Zero cross-user leakage
Token budget respected
Sensitive information filtered